 "note": "Quick, Draw! flower 6125487162130432: a small round centre (0), five looped petals drawn one at a time around it, upper right (1), lower right (2), bottom (3), left (4) and upper left (5), and a straight stem going down (6). In the film a pink water lily is seen from above, floating on the water; the doodle is laid on it with its centre on the lily's yellow centre and its petals over the lily's petals. The whole flower is placed by its centre and a point straight above it, so it drifts with the water and turns a little as the lily turns. The stem turns at its top about the centre, aimed at a foot point that lags behind the head, so the stalk trails in the water as the flower drifts.",
